                <div class="card-header">
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">
                        <i class="fas fa-star text-warning-500 mr-2"></i>Key Features
                    </h2>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                        <div class="feature-card p-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-50 to-primary-100 dark:from-primary-900/20 dark:to-primary-800/20 rounded-xl">
                            <i class="fas fa-users text-primary-500 text-3xl mb-3"></i>
                            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">User Management</h3>
                            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
                                Complete user management system with roles, permissions, and profile management.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="feature-card p-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-success-50 to-success-100 dark:from-success-900/20 dark:to-success-800/20 rounded-xl">
                            <i class="fas fa-puzzle-piece text-success-500 text-3xl mb-3"></i>
                            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Modular System</h3>
                            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
                                Plugin-based architecture allowing easy extension and customization.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="feature-card p-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-info-50 to-info-100 dark:from-info-900/20 dark:to-info-800/20 rounded-xl">
                            <i class="fas fa-chart-bar text-info-500 text-3xl mb-3"></i>
                            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Analytics</h3>
                            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
                                Built-in analytics and reporting system with audit logging.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="feature-card p-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-warning-50 to-warning-100 dark:from-warning-900/20 dark:to-warning-800/20 rounded-xl">
                            <i class="fas fa-shield-alt text-warning-500 text-3xl mb-3"></i>
                            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Security</h3>
                            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
                                Advanced security features with permission-based access control.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="feature-card p-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-purple-100 dark:from-purple-900/20 dark:to-purple-800/20 rounded-xl">
                            <i class="fas fa-mobile-alt text-purple-500 text-3xl mb-3"></i>
                            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Responsive</h3>
                            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
                                Mobile-first responsive design that works on all devices.
                            </p>
